    "html": "<p>Three identical resistors of resistance R are connected as shown to a battery with a potential difference of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12 V\"></span> and an internal resistance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{2}\"></span>. A voltmeter is connected across one of the resistors.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the reading on the voltmeter?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3 V\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 V\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6 V\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8 V\"></span></li></ol>"
